flowchart LR
    Customer[Customer] -->|Auth0 sign-in| Magento[Magento Storefront]
    Customer -->|Registration| Magento
    Magento -->|HTTPS REST: registration/company data| Profile[Profile Service]
    Profile -->|HTTPS REST: create/update company and contact| CRMAPI[CRM API facade]
    CRMAPI -->|HTTPS Dataverse Web API| DV[(Microsoft Dataverse)]
    Staff[Internal Staff] -->|Entra ID sign-in| Admin[Admin Backoffice]
    Admin -->|HTTPS REST| CRMAPI
    Admin -.->|Future option: secured Dataverse-backed API| DV

    Magento -->|Catalog changes| CatalogSync[Catalog Sync Integration]
    CatalogSync -->|Dataverse Web API| DV

    DV -->|Async business events| Bus[(Azure Service Bus)]
    Bus --> Notify[Notification / OTP Service]
    Bus --> Other[Other subscribed services]

    Financing[Financing Portal] -->|HTTPS REST: application| FinAPI[Financing Integration API]
    FinAPI -->|Dataverse Web API| DV
    FinAPI -->|Partner-specific API / agreed protocol| Banks[Lending Partners]
    Banks -->|Decision/status callback or polling| FinAPI
    FinAPI -->|Update application and partner status| DV

    DV <-->|HTTPS REST: document metadata/reference| Docs[Document Service]
